  <main class="main" id="main">
    <section class="page active" id="page-home">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR PERSONAL CODING SPACE</div><h1>Build something<br><span>extraordinary.</span></h1><p>Learn code, explore tools, and turn your ideas into real projects — one step at a time.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn primary" data-page="academy">Start learning <span>↗</span></button><button class="btn secondary" data-page="workspace">Open workspace</button></div></div>
        <div class="hero-orb"><div class="orb-ring ring-a"></div><div class="orb-ring ring-b"></div><div class="orb-core">❄</div><span class="orb-tag tag-one">CODE</span><span class="orb-tag tag-two">CREATE</span><span class="orb-tag tag-three">LEARN</span></div>
